name: Seaboard BLOCK M: viola
by: ROLI, "Seaboard BLOCK M: Any instrument is possible. Anywhere." (YouTube sAKCSkkxzRM); written for odo by Claude
about: A short excerpt of ROLI's demo, to learn from: ROLI, "Seaboard BLOCK M: Any instrument is possible. Anywhere." (YouTube sAKCSkkxzRM), 1:03.0 to 1:19.0,
about: played on a Seaboard with SWAM Viola. Music and performance theirs (all rights reserved).
about: Transcribed for odo by machine (Basic Pitch) with each note's own pitch curve (bends, scoops,
about: vibrato) and loudness (pressure) measured from the recording, in free time (one beat a second).
about: On the Hex (Wicki-Hayden, chromatic): the keyboard: viola. Bends played as on the Hex: two fingers in the key, slid out of it.
about: A test of how close a touch screen gets to the Seaboard: listen against the video.
